# Confidential scan reports — full findings on third-party code must never be
# committed (responsible-disclosure + data-classification). Only *-public.json
# (findings stripped via _redact_public_payload) belongs in the repo. Self-scan
# reports (spectra-self-*) are the one allowed exception — own code, opt-in.
*-confidential.json
*-confidential.html
!**/spectra-self*-confidential.*

# Stale directories
archive/
cortex-vault/
memory/
